Explanation:

Equilibrium at TOA requires $(1-alpha)S_0/4 = sigma T_e^4$. Solving with $S_0=1367 "W/m"^2$, $alpha=0.30$, and $sigma=5.67 times 10^(-8) "W/(m"^2"K"^4")"$ yields $T_e approx 254.9 "K" approx 255 "K"$.
